Z||000023||ray b||10-24-2001||08:35 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by falconhulk:<BR><B>Ray not sure about MTB, but they also use alcohol to change the octane rating today.....and its clean burning.<P>[This message has been edited by falconhulk (edited 10-24-2001).]</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>READ THE PUMP epa warnings they list whats in the gas in south Fl mostly donot use alcohal but all do use MTB or MTBE more if hi test.<BR>REGULAR GAS HAS SAME DETERGENTS AS HI-TEST mostly some brands may vary but all have some detergents in them.<P><P>------------------<BR>Question wonder and be wierd||||reg||1
