Z||000033||MinnGreenGT||10-25-2001||11:15 AM||||I typically run mid-grade gas, premium for long road trips (it does seem to make more of a difference then).  My 3.1 is "built" a little (higher compression, but not like Standard's Quad-4  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">).  I also just dumped a bottle of Injector cleaner in there- WOW! that made so much difference... I was shocked.  I'll probably start doing that at least once a year ($3 won't kill you... try it!)<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
